ns  I don't think we'll see him in season 4  which is why I encourage every anime  only viewer to at least have a read of  the manga if you really want to know  more about this amazing character and  finally subscribe to the channel if you  like this video I would really  appreciate it and I'm trying to reach  100 subs by the end of October and I  really think it's possible if everyone  who watched this video subscribes to my  channel as usual shout out to everyone  who retweeted my last video the Twitter  handle should be on the screen right now  and I'll see you next week peace
 

